# Learn › lesson 1 (Drift): holding a direction completes the first step, the second (glowing
# markers) is skipped from the banner, and the lesson ends with its results; Next opens lesson 2.
until 300 Gravity Hollow
frames 150
click =Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Learn
until 120 You are a hollow
frames 20
save lesson-1
hold ArrowRight
frames 120
release ArrowRight
until 120 Drift to each glowing marker
frames 10
save markers
click =Skip lesson
until 300 Lesson complete!
frames 30
save lesson-results
click =Next
until 120 Pale motes are smaller than you
frames 10
save lesson-2
